      "consequence": "Each apply of the app group removes the SSH rule and the next apply adds it again. Engineers lose bastion access unpredictably and plans never settle.",
      "fix": "Move the SSH rule into an inline ingress block on aws_security_group.app. Alternatively convert all app group rules to standalone rule resources."
    },
