      "line_end": 16,
      "title": "Database security group does not allow Postgres traffic",
      "description": "The orders database reuses the app security group, which only allows inbound TCP 443 from the VPC. No rule allows inbound port 5432. The app hosts cannot connect to the orders database. Every query from the shop API will time out. Create a dedicated database security group. Allow TCP 5432 inbound from the app security group only.",
      "suggested_change": "  vpc_security_group_ids  = [aws_security_group.orders_db.id]",
      "source": null,
      "candidate": null,
      "notes": [],
